                        "review": "+Little \"Get the ball into the hole\" maze game\n\n-It has 2 buy options, both of which I believe are too expensive\n-Not very fun for a long while\n-Other have this game built into it\n-Very Niche\n\n2.5/5\n\nInteresting concept but not enough to keep anyone entertained for very long I think. It's simply one of those little get the ball to the hole mazes. You play in a fun little environment, but overall the game play is very lacking. It feels like the main element of this game should have been part of a full title. I've actually seen some VR Escape Room titles that have this as a puzzle in the game.  Overall, niche I'd give it a neutral because some people might enjoy it. But personally, I feel there should be more into this. \n\nIf you liked this review [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/33220185-VR-Games-and-Tools/]Click here[/url] and follow for more reviews of VR titles.",
